ess Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"18\" valign=\"top\" width=\"641\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"18\" valign=\"top\" width=\"641\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"18\" valign=\"top\" width=\"641\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b> </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CSBC Admit Card\" href=\"https://apply-csbc.com/csbc_12026_weadmitcard/searchApplication\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Exam City&nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Exam City and Admit Card\" href=\"https://apply-csbc.com/csbc_12026_weadmitcard/applicationIndex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Exam Notice</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"t